<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PRISM - Admin</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #000000;
            --panel-bg: #09090b;
            --input-bg: #0d0d0d;
            --border-grey: #262626;
            --text-main: #ffffff;
            --text-dim: #71717a;
            --accent-blue: #2563eb;
            --accent-blue-hover: #1d4ed8;
            --rainbow: linear-gradient(to right, #3b82f6, #10b981, #f59e0b, #ef4444, #a855f7, #ec4899);
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
        }

        .nav-right {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-right a, .nav-right span {
            cursor: pointer;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-right a:hover, .nav-right span:hover { color: #fff; }

        #admin-gate {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
            color: var(--text-dim);
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        #admin-layout {
            display: none;
            min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
        }

        .admin-shell {
            display: flex;
            min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
        }

        .utility-sidebar {
            width: 260px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
            background: #050505;
            padding: 24px 16px;
        }

        .utility-sidebar h2 {
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.2px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin: 0 0 16px 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .utility-btn {
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: left;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .utility-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .utility-btn.active {
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12);
            border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .utility-content {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 28px 36px 48px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .panel-header {
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .panel-header h2 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .panel-subtitle {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .prompt-section {
            margin-bottom: 36px;
        }

        .section-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
        }

        .section-header h3 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
        }

        .empty-section {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 13px;
            padding: 16px;
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px dashed var(--border-grey);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .section-defaults {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .btn-tone-default {
            background: #111;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
            border-radius: 999px;
            color: #d4d4d8;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-tone-default:hover {
            border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.5);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-tone-default i {
            font-size: 10px;
            margin-right: 4px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
        }

        .prompt-card {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .prompt-card-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .prompt-card-header h3 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .prompt-version-badge {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.6px;
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);
            color: #93c5fd;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .prompt-meta {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .prompt-meta i { margin-right: 6px; width: 14px; }

        .prompt-textarea {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 220px;
            background: var(--input-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            font-family: 'Consolas', 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.55;
            white-space: pre;
            overflow-wrap: normal;
            overflow-x: auto;
            resize: vertical;
            outline: none;
            tab-size: 4;
            -moz-tab-size: 4;
        }

        .prompt-textarea:focus {
            border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.6);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);
        }

        .motivation-row {
            margin-top: 14px;
        }

        .motivation-row label {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .required { color: #ef4444; }

        .char-hint { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-weight: 600; }

        .motivation-input {
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--input-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
            outline: none;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .motivation-input:focus { border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.6); }

        .prompt-actions {
            margin-top: 14px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--accent-blue);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--accent-blue-hover); }
        .btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: not-allowed; }

        .btn-ghost {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-ghost:hover {
            color: #fff;
            border-color: #444;
        }

        .version-history {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding-top: 16px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
        }

        .version-history h4 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
        }

        .version-item {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #050505;
        }

        .version-toggle {
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: #e4e4e7;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: left;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .version-toggle:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); }

        .version-toggle-meta {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-weight: 400;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .version-chevron {
            transition: transform 0.2s;
            margin-right: 8px;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
        }

        .version-chevron.open { transform: rotate(90deg); }

        .version-body {
            display: none;
            padding: 0 14px 14px;
            border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
        }

        .version-body.open { display: block; }

        .version-motivation {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin: 12px 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .version-text {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 12px;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-family: 'Consolas', 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.55;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            tab-size: 4;
            overflow-x: auto;
            color: #d4d4d8;
        }

        .empty-history {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin: 0;
        }

        .loading-state, .error-state, .prompt-cards-loading {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 14px;
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .modal-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            z-index: 10000;
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .modal-overlay.visible { display: flex; }

        .modal-dialog {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 460px;
            background: #0d0d0d;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .modal-rainbow { height: 3px; background: var(--rainbow); }

        .modal-body { padding: 24px; }

        .modal-body h3 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .modal-body p {
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .form-group input, .form-group .readonly-field {
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--input-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .readonly-field { color: var(--text-dim); }

        .modal-actions {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .btn-cancel {
            background: #27272a;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: inherit;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <img src="/images/logo_senza_scritta_piccola.png" alt="PRISM Logo" style="width: 110px; height: auto;">
    <div class="nav-right">
        <a href="/dashboard"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Dashboard</a>
        <span onclick="firebase.auth().signOut().then(() => window.location.href='/login')" style="color: #ef4444; font-weight: 600;">
            <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i> Logout
        </span>
    </div>
</header>

<div id="admin-gate">
    <i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Verifica accesso admin...
</div>

<div id="admin-layout">
    <div class="admin-shell">
        <aside class="utility-sidebar">
            <h2>Utility</h2>
            <button type="button" class="utility-btn active" data-utility="prompts">
                <i class="fas fa-file-code"></i> Gestione prompt
            </button>
        </aside>
        <main class="utility-content" id="utility-content"></main>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="add-prompt-modal" class="modal-overlay" onclick="if(event.target===this) closeAddPromptModal()">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
        <div class="modal-rainbow"></div>
        <div class="modal-body">
            <h3>Nuovo prompt</h3>
            <p>Aggiungi un prompt alla sezione selezionata. Potrai inserire il testo subito dopo la creazione.</p>
            <input type="hidden" id="addPromptSection" value="">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Sezione</label>
                <div class="readonly-field" id="addPromptSectionLabel"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="addPromptName">Nome prompt</label>
                <input type="text" id="addPromptName" placeholder="Es. confidente, facebook, System Instructions..." maxlength="80">
            </div>
            <div class="modal-actions">
                <button type="button" class="btn-cancel" onclick="closeAddPromptModal()">Annulla</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn-primary" onclick="submitNewPrompt()"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i> Crea prompt</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.8.0/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.8.0/firebase-auth-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.8.0/firebase-firestore-compat.js"></script>
<script src="/firebase-config.js"></script>
<script>
    initFirebaseConfig("<%= env %>");
</script>
<script src="/prism-error-popup.js"></script>
<script src="/admin-page.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
